---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="The Exoteric Archives: Primary Source Esoteric Texts"
  description="Explore the unredacted historical records, suppressed manuscripts, and foundational mythologies of the esoteric continuum."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section" style="padding: 0;">
      
    <!-- WAYFINDING CONDUIT -->
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 0 20px;">
      <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Archive Navigation">
        <ul class="breadcrumb-trail">
          <li><a href="/">↵ History SQ</a></li>
          <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li class="current-node" aria-current="page">The Archives</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="adjacent-node">
          <a href="/the-escape-matrix/">Engage the Matrix &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="hero reveal" aria-labelledby="hero-heading" style="min-height: 60vh; padding-top: 80px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2);">
      <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">The Primary-Source Repository</div>
        <h1 id="hero-heading" style="text-transform: uppercase;">
          The Exoteric<br>
          <em style="display: block; margin-top: 15px;">Archives</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-body">
          Before the active mechanisms of the Enneagrammatic Escape Matrix can be engaged, the initiate must establish a rigorous, source-critical foundation. The Archives house the unredacted historical records, suppressed manuscripts, and foundational mythologies of the esoteric continuum. This is the bedrock of the Great Work—divorced from modern metaphysical distortion and grounded entirely in empirical text.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- DUAL FOUNDATIONS -->
    <section class="matrix-tier" aria-labelledby="directory-heading" style="padding: 80px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.1);">
      <header class="tier-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Select a Trajectory</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="directory-heading">The Dual Foundations</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;">
          
        <!-- Column 1: Sacred History -->
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">The Manuscript Record</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--shsq-gold);">Sacred History</h3>
          <p>
            The public record of human spirituality is heavily redacted. Enter this archive to explore the primary-source translations and structural analyses of the Nag Hammadi Library, the Qumran discoveries, and the suppressed Apocryphal traditions that expose the Demiurgic fault.
          </p>
          <ul style="color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>The Apocryphon of John</li>
            <li>The Reality of the Rulers</li>
            <li>The Gospel of Thomas</li>
            <li>The Dead Sea Scrolls</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/sacred-history/" class="btn btn-primary" style="align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto;">
            Access the Manuscripts &rarr;
          </a>
        </article>

        <!-- Column 2: Historical Mythology -->
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">The Exoteric Threshold</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--shsq-gold);">Historical Mythology</h3>
          <p>
            Comparative mythology is not arbitrary folklore; it is a highly codified technology of human initiation. Uncover the structural roots of global traditions—from the Vedic architectures of non-dualism to the mechanical maps of the Platonic Underworld and the Hermetic Tarot.
          </p>
          <ul style="color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Vedic &amp; Upanishadic Mechanics</li>
            <li>The Egyptian &amp; Platonic Underworld</li>
            <li>Astro-Theology &amp; The Stellar Cult</li>
            <li>The Monomyth as Ritual Mechanic</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/historical-mythology/" class="btn btn-primary" style="align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto;">
            Access the Myths &rarr;
          </a>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading">The Evidential Standard</h2>
      <p>
        Every text within this repository is subjected to rigorous source-critical analysis. We trace manuscript provenance, verify translation layers, and explicitly exclude contemporary New Age speculation. The maps provided here are exact, unfiltered, and strictly historical.
      </p>
      <a href="/source-methodology/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Review Our Methodology &rarr;
      </a>
    </aside>

  </main>
</Layout>